          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Vulnerability found\n\nHardcoded public contract name ('Nu Token') is exposed in the Bank contract function.\n\nImpact: Exposure of contract name, which could aid attackers in identifying and targeting vulnerable contracts.\n\nRemediation: Store hardcoded secrets securely, e.g., as off-chain constants or using a secure configuration management system."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
